communication_instructions.md is a feed-only adaptation of Slopotron:
https://github.com/beaverbeard/slopotron
Source revision: 297148ac987417603a2107a41cec694f093e00a2 (2026-09-14 retrieval)
Original: .claude/skills/slopotron/SKILL.md, version 2026-09.

Adaptation: applies to the agent's own user-facing communication only, not to
manuscripts, proposed author edits, summaries, canon/graph data or quotations.
Standalone Detect/Fix reports, scoring, detector claims and messenger-only
formatting are not used. The original credits Every's Compound Writing (MIT)
for the provenance and self-commentary categories.

